# 57. COMPLETE HOSPITAL DASHBOARD STRUCTURE

Meri recommendation mein hospital ke dashboard system ko 6 layers mein organize karna best rahega.

### Layer 1: Executive Dashboards
Hospital Owner, Director, Hospital Admin.

### Layer 2: Clinical Dashboards
Medical Superintendent, HOD, Doctor, Resident Doctor, Nurse.

### Layer 3: Critical Care & Procedure Dashboards
Emergency, ICU, OT, Anaesthesia, Dialysis.

### Layer 4: Diagnostic & Treatment Support
Laboratory, Pathology, Radiology, Pharmacy, Blood Bank.

### Layer 5: Business & Operations
Reception, Admission, Bed Management, Billing, Insurance, Accounts, Inventory, Purchase, HR.

### Layer 6: Facility, Quality & Digital
Housekeeping, CSSD, Diet, Biomedical, Maintenance, Ambulance, Quality, Infection Control, IT, Patient Portal.

